# Implementation plan — Spec 1.7.0

## Summary

Spec 1.7.0 adds **`ImagePreview`** to `@webonone/ui-kit`, refactors Identity profile avatar, and improves dialog/phone patterns: **AlertDialog** delete confirm, sibling stacked dialogs via **`stackLevel`**, phone showcase cleanup, and Media selector crop stacking. See [01-overview.md](./01-overview.md), [02-image-preview-component.md](./02-image-preview-component.md), [03-ui-kit-improvements.md](./03-ui-kit-improvements.md).

## Branch and prerequisites

| Item | Value |
|------|--------|
| Branch | `spec/1.7.0` |
| Package build | `npm run build -w @webonone/ui-kit` before consumer prod builds |
| Media integration | Consumer-only via existing `ProfileMediaSelectorModal` — no UI Kit → Media import |

