## Phase 4 — UI Kit dialog & phone improvements

**Goal:** AlertDialog delete, sibling stacked nested dialogs, phone showcase cleanup, Media crop stacking.

**Exit criteria:** Showcase demos updated; Media crop stacks correctly; type-checks pass.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Add `stackLevel` prop | `ui-kit/package/src/components/CustomDialog.tsx` |
| AlertDialog delete demo | `ui-kit/showcase/src/pages/DialogsPage.tsx` |
| Sibling nested demo | `DialogsPage.tsx` — outer + inner as siblings, `stackLevel={1}` on inner |
| Remove plain phone demo | `ui-kit/showcase/src/pages/ControlsPage.tsx` |
| Sibling crop dialog | `media/frontend/src/features/media/pages/SelectorPage.tsx` |
| Crop stackLevel | `media/frontend/src/features/media/components/ImageCropDialog.tsx` |

**Verify:** `npm run type-check -w ui-kit-root`, `npm run type-check -w media-root`

---

## Cross-service integration

| Layer | Channel |
|-------|---------|
| ImagePreview → Media | Consumer `onEdit` → `CustomDialog` + `MediaSelectorFrame` (Identity) |
| Crop over selector | Media iframe sibling `ImageCropDialog` with `stackLevel={1}` inside selector embed |
| JWT to Media iframe | Unchanged — `sendMediaInit` in consumer |

UI Kit must **not** import `@webonone/media-embed` or Media service code.

