## Risks and open items

- ClickUp AC text says "40×40 pixels" but specifies `w-40`/`h-40` — follow Tailwind classes (160px), consistent with 1.5.0 profile.
- Identity outer dialog cannot guard iframe-internal crop; stacking fix lives in Media `SelectorPage`.

---

## Final verification

```bash
npm run build -w @webonone/ui-kit
npm run type-check -w ui-kit-root
npm run type-check -w identity-root
npm run type-check -w media-root
```

Manual: Identity profile → Edit → click image → Media selector opens → upload image → crop dialog stacks above selector.
